              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito asked whether a Sixth Amendment right to effective assistance of counsel in the first post\u2011conviction proceeding would affect the attribution of fault to the prisoner."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "342187631083a1b5b4d1afbb03b84830fefcfb944b33539ae80731feebce5105",
