        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Alito, justice Alito inquired about the issue the Court may have left open in *Coleman*, specifically whether the Sixth Amendment applies in the first post\u2011conviction proceeding or whether a non\u2011constitutional basis could relieve the prisoner of fault."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "342187631083a1b5b4d1afbb03b84830fefcfb944b33539ae80731feebce5105",
